      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VICKY'S FURY (2) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors four starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (25.36) at Ballarat over 450m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can go on with it. WHIZZ MAXIMUS (8) goes very well at the course with three wins and a placing from five starts. Recorded a 2.25 lengths win (25.48) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks a key chance on best figures. RAPPER (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (22.64) last time in a Mix 6/7 at Warrnambool. One of the better chances. SCOTT IMPOSTER (7) warrants respect with the drop in journey.",
